      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُضَمِّرٌ</span></b>  One <i>who prepares his horses, by reducing
them to scanty food,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُضَمِّرُهَا</span>,) <i>for a military expedition</i> or <i>for racing.</i> (TA.)

